    {
      "section": "memorial_description",
      "text": "A black granite tablet with the 78 Squadron crest is fixed to the east abutment of the footbridge over the Hull River in Tickton. The gold lettering records the collision, lists the dead and ends with the words 'one remaining survivor'. IWM lists 15 names; the inscription as transcribed on our record gives only ten of the dead.",
